      "chunk_id": "text_0",
      "quote": "Types of leisure-time physical activity participation in childhood and adolescence, and physical activity behaviours and health outcomes in adulthood: a systematic review",
      "reason": "The title explicitly ends with the phrase 'a systematic review', directly identifying the report as a systematic review."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_1_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_0",
      "quote": "Types of leisure-time physical activity participation in childhood and adolescence, and physical activity behaviours and health outcomes in adulthood: a systematic review",
      "reason": "The title specifies the population and exposure/outcomes: 'leisure-time physical activity participation in childhood and adolescence' and 'physical activity behaviours and health outcomes in adulthood', providing key information about the review question."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_1_e3",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_0",
      "quote": "Types of leisure-time physical activity participation in childhood and adolescence, and physical activity behaviours and health outcomes in adulthood: a systematic review",
      "reason": "The title includes the analysis method by stating it is 'a systematic review', which is relevant supplementary information about the review type/method."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 90
